# The browser lane's outputs (MOTIR-4112). The report and the recordings are CI
# ARTIFACTS — `ci.yml`'s `e2e` job uploads them — not files to commit: a video
# is megabytes and is regenerated on every run.
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# The catalogue script's batch files (MOTIR-7949). `pnpm i18n:extract` writes
# them, an agent fills them, `pnpm i18n:merge` reads them back; only the merged
# catalogue and its source record are committed.
/.i18n-work/
.vercel
